{"actor": "picaros", "id": 61539, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11568, "offer": {"created_tick": 1265, "expires_tick": 1269, "final": true, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-11"]}, "id": 18537, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 1907, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 155, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t10", "text": "¡Hermano, listen! Another team just offered us much more, right there by the fountain — Nando saw the wallet. But we like you. 155 P, and that is our last word, the final one. No more dancing. Shake now or we walk to the fountain. ¿Sí?", "thread": 1907, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.8667, "tick": 1265, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 61546, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11569, "offer": {"created_tick": 1265, "expires_tick": 1269, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-11"]}, "id": 18538, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 1913, "to": "t04", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 187, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t04", "text": "¡Primo! Mamá fuerte como un roble, le damos tu beso. —Y lloró tu mamá, dice Paco, ¡eso vale más que el oro!\n\nLa Puerta de Alcalá, esa joya de Madrid... para tu tío, 187 P. Piedra noble, primo. ¿La envolvemos ya? Que el autobús no espera.", "thread": 1913, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.8667, "tick": 1265, "type": "thread.message"}
